# Note: Data/providers.db is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The assignment requires shipping the SQLite database file with the
# submission so reviewers can run the app without first launching it.
# But the SQLite write-ahead log / shared-memory sidecar files ARE
# transient and must never be committed.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
